  "notes": "Fixes two reliability problems: AO3 export now rewrites the required Multi category icon into literal-color background-image rules that avoid the rejected background shorthand/CSS-variable syntax, and the desktop updater now cache-busts both manifest and payload requests so newly published versions are not hidden by stale raw.githubusercontent.com CDN responses. Update HTTP failures now surface as failures instead of being reported as Up to date."
